{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"16192","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/16192","key":"MC-227097","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"01/Jun/21 3:50 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>When you place blocks inside of an end portal, then light the portal, the blocks get deleted. They don't even drop anything, so the block is gone forever.</p>\n\n<p>What I expected to happen was:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>The blocks will drop when the end portal opens</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>What actually happened was:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>The blocks get deleted and don't drop anything</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Steps to reproduce:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Build an end portal but don't put in the eyes</li>\n\t<li>Place blocks in the middle of the end portal</li>\n\t<li>Put in the eyes; the blocks will get deleted</li>\n\t<li>Go through the portal</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>Notice that the blocks got deleted, but they did&nbsp;<em>not</em> drop anything</p>\n\n<p>Fix suggestions:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Easy fix: Make it so the blocks drop when destroyed by the end portal</li>\n\t<li>Hard fix: Make it so the portal will not open until there is nothing in the way</li>\n</ul>\n","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"22/Sep/21 10:40 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/27213","id":"27213","filename":"End portal deletes blocks.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatar